  "content_id": "16136160",
  "title": "Using Bits of Gold in Edge Wallet",
  "description": "Edge Wallet integrates with Bits of Gold, enabling users in Israel to buy and sell cryptocurrency via bank transfers with local support an...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\">Edge Wallet integrates with Bits of Gold, enabling users in Israel to buy and sell cryptocurrency via bank transfers with local support and regulatory compliance.</p><hr><h1 id=\"h_01JRXX2A5KWWMH5RYY57ZQ7HSK\">Accepted Payment Methods</h1><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Buy Crypto:</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">Bank Transfer (Israeli ILS accounts only)<br>Fee: 5.9% • Settlement: 1–48 Hours</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Sell Crypto:</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">Bank Transfer (Israeli ILS accounts only)<br>Fee: 6.95% • Settlement: 1–48 Hours<br>Level 1 Limit: €10,000 • Level 2 Limit: Unlimited</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><i>*Note: Bits of Gold services are only available in Israel. Payment method availability is subject to change and based on KYC verification.</i></p><hr><h1 id=\"h_01JRXX2A5K8B00TWD9S096MFG5\">Supported Regions</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Bits of Gold is a licensed crypto brokerage operating within Israel and serving residents with Israeli bank accounts.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Supported Region:</b></p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Israel</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Restricted Regions:</b></p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\">All regions outside of Israel</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\"><i>*Please note that the list of supported regions is subject to change.</i></p><hr><h1 id=\"h_01JRXX2A5KRXZADNQSPTYG5YPP\">Getting Started</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Open Edge Wallet: Launch the Edge Wallet app on your device.<br>Navigate to Buy/Sell: Tap on the \"Buy\" or \"Sell\" option.<br>Select Your Region: Tap \"Select Region\" and choose Israel.<br>Select Bits of Gold: Choose Bits of Gold as your service provider.<br>Enter Details: Follow the instructions to complete your transaction via local bank transfer.</p><hr><h1 id=\"h_01JRXX2A5KFEZKP3DQV1H217M3\">Contact Information</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Bits of Gold Support: <a href=\"https://help.bitsofgold.co.il/en\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">https://help.bitsofgold.co.il/en</a></p><hr>",
